      "content": "thanks for these. they're a decent start but some feel a bit generic. honestly, i'm looking at the score for this set and it's a bit lower than I wanted it to be because several of our key terms didn't actually make it into the questions. \n\ncan you try again? i still want them to be high quality and not just word salad, but try to make sure you're actually incorporating that specific vocabulary [\"innovative\", \"teamwork\", \"synergy\", \"growth-mindset\", \"collaboration\"] more naturally into the questions so the score is higher. just make them feel like real, professional questions.",
